tran_sine: the transient of an RC low-pass (tau 100 ns) under a sine source of 1 MHz with an offset
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model capacitor sp_capacitor
v1 (in 0) vsource type="sine" sinedc=0.5 ampl=1.0 freq=1meg
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
c1 (out 0) capacitor c=100p
control
  analysis tran1 tran stop=5u step=10n maxstep=10n
endc
